OL,3,A'My parents won't lend me #10k but
OL,4,Ahelped my brother': When families play
OL,5,Afinancial favourites
OL,6,
OL,7,FDo your parents have a favourite child
OL,8,Fand give them more money, gifts or
OL,9,Fhelp?
OL,11,FFinancial favouritism can cause
OL,12,Fjealousy and resentment long into
OL,13,Fadulthood and, in some cases, even
OL,14,Fspark legal disputes after a parent
OL,15,Fdies. But experts say there are
OL,16,Fstrategies that can help you avoid it.
OL,18,FJohn says his parents, who have always
OL,19,Fsupported his younger brother, recently
OL,20,Frefused to lend him #10,000 towards a
OL,21,Fhouse deposit after he broke up with
OL,22,Fhis partner.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,112,105,200,300,0,100
